{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/e1d8de60b6b407681830dd513ec01d73.avif?t=1760321744\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creating your digital self has always been a challenge.<br>Too much equipment. Too much software. Too much money. Too little freedom. A real headache\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VDIGM changes that , starting now</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introducing\u00a0TIH (Talk, Interact, Humanize):</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The must-have service for those who want an experience where your voice, your style, and your world come together : powered by\u00a0<strong>AI &amp; Unreal Engine 5.6!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TIH is the first <strong>3D avatar</strong> service for <strong>streamers</strong> that requires no <strong>motion tracking equipment</strong> and is fully <strong>compatible with OBS.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here to share a story, build a persona, or find something that blurs the line between virtual and real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TIH gives you an\u00a0<strong>affordable\u00a0</strong>way to express yourself in ways you never imagined possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No expensive gear. No limits. Just you and your camera</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/fe89cdba38234b56f8595dd22b8f4335.webp?t=1760321744\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/fe89cdba38234b56f8595dd22b8f4335.poster.avif?t=1760321744\" class=\"bb_img\" width=720 height=480 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/6bb72b53dc8c35a483c919eb3c1a1519.webp?t=1760321744\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/6bb72b53dc8c35a483c919eb3c1a1519.poster.avif?t=1760321744\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Equipment\u00a0: Responsive AI Avatar\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience VDIGM\u2019s motion tracking AI avatar and enjoy a new level of freedom with our <strong>camera-based motion tracking technology</strong>. Our system enables real-time mirrored movements and natural responses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/5784664b40c84a169235cc79969dfe6a.webp?t=1760321744\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/5784664b40c84a169235cc79969dfe6a.poster.avif?t=1760321744\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/af9609e7e00e727f36b1e677f81dab55.poster.avif?t=1760321744\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/af9609e7e00e727f36b1e677f81dab55.webm?t=1760321744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/af9609e7e00e727f36b1e677f81dab55.mp4?t=1760321744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience your 3D self\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Generative AI Avatar:</strong> TIH lets you <strong>generate</strong> your own avatar with just a <strong>single photo</strong> using your <strong>smartphone camera</strong>, <strong>webcam</strong>, or <strong>other device</strong>, thanks to our continuously updated AI models and training data</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/2bd413c2d07151d4f0b440301773da8b.avif?t=1760321744\" width=800 height=325 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose from many accessories and stages available</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide variety of accessories and virtual stages to personalize your <strong>3D avatar</strong>. From unique outfits and props to immersive environments, <strong>TIH</strong> gives you everything you need to create the perfect look and setting for any livestream, video, or podcast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/7eec6f9ea93623a9fb40ee41e3e8e769.avif?t=1760321744\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/83c343c7aad31f2507fded710268457e.webp?t=1760321744\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/83c343c7aad31f2507fded710268457e.poster.avif?t=1760321744\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Train It, Script It, Watch It</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design</strong>\u00a0your own\u00a0<strong>AI persona :</strong>\u00a0Write its personality prompt, choose a voice or train it with your own, and watch it behave and react exactly the way you imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/bbb37d5ad844452ec4853634f8fe3399.webp?t=1760321744\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/bbb37d5ad844452ec4853634f8fe3399.poster.avif?t=1760321744\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even\u00a0<strong>generate full video podcasts</strong>\u00a0from a simple script, whether it\u2019s a solo show or a group with up to 4 avatars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/08065965552e0c3fffa471f1ee6fc8b4.poster.avif?t=1760321744\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/08065965552e0c3fffa471f1ee6fc8b4.webm?t=1760321744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/08065965552e0c3fffa471f1ee6fc8b4.mp4?t=1760321744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay connected with your fan or streamer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get an<strong>\u00a0AI NPC\u00a0</strong>to\u00a0<strong>co-host</strong>\u00a0your live streams and react in real time alongside you. Let it perform signature poses or fan-requested reactions during broadcast, acting as your expressive and tireless co-host.<br>Give your audience the power to cast your<strong>\u00a0AI NPC</strong>\u00a0in their own videos or podcasts extending your presence beyond your own channel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/37de1e6db6f967ff11f917180b704df3.avif?t=1760321744\" width=800 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our mission with <strong>TIH ( Talk, Interact, Humanize )</strong> is not simply to build avatars; it\u2019s to make <strong>avatar technology available and affordable for everyone</strong>. That\u2019s why our team has pushed the boundaries of what is currently possible to create the most accurate <strong>camera-based motion tracking system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We are the ONLY\u00a0platform that allows full-body camera motion tracking:</strong> no suits, no expensive gear, just you and your imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/ec07dec7210182720ca4995d39266af9.avif?t=1760321744\" width=800 height=516 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3823170?t=1760321744","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/cb3710dcec234f2d731e1478fd5c0575483d8e31/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760321744","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/1364eec0cafdb049b50c1edf4acba9288420fe80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760321744","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/1364eec0cafdb049b50c1edf4acba9288420fe80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760321744","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/e1d8de60b6b407681830dd513ec01d73.avif?t=1760321744\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creating your digital self has always been a challenge.<br>Too much equipment. Too much software. Too much money. Too little freedom. A real headache\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VDIGM changes that , starting now</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introducing\u00a0TIH (Talk, Interact, Humanize):</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The must-have service for those who want an experience where your voice, your style, and your world come together : powered by\u00a0<strong>AI &amp; Unreal Engine 5.6!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TIH is the first <strong>3D avatar</strong> service for <strong>streamers</strong> that requires no <strong>motion tracking equipment</strong> and is fully <strong>compatible with OBS.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here to share a story, build a persona, or find something that blurs the line between virtual and real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TIH gives you an\u00a0<strong>affordable\u00a0</strong>way to express yourself in ways you never imagined possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No expensive gear. No limits. Just you and your camera</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/fe89cdba38234b56f8595dd22b8f4335.webp?t=1760321744\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/fe89cdba38234b56f8595dd22b8f4335.poster.avif?t=1760321744\" class=\"bb_img\" width=720 height=480 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/6bb72b53dc8c35a483c919eb3c1a1519.webp?t=1760321744\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/6bb72b53dc8c35a483c919eb3c1a1519.poster.avif?t=1760321744\" class=\"bb_img