p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/2bd413c2d07151d4f0b440301773da8b.avif?t=1760321744\" width=800 height=325 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose from many accessories and stages available</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide variety of accessories and virtual stages to personalize your <strong>3D avatar</strong>. From unique outfits and props to immersive environments, <strong>TIH</strong> gives you everything you need to create the perfect look and setting for any livestream, video, or podcast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/7eec6f9ea93623a9fb40ee41e3e8e769.avif?t=1760321744\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/83c343c7aad31f2507fded710268457e.webp?t=1760321744\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/83c343c7aad31f2507fded710268457e.poster.avif?t=1760321744\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Train It, Script It, Watch It</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design</strong>\u00a0your own\u00a0<strong>AI persona :</strong>\u00a0Write its personality prompt, choose a voice or train it with your own, and watch it behave and react exactly the way you imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823170/extras/bbb37d5ad844452ec4853634f8fe3399.webp?t=1760321744\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as